<section class="panel-stack <%= panelClass('embed') %>" data-panel="embed">
  <article class="card section-panel">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Embed & Notice</p>
        <h3>임베드 및 공지</h3>
        <p class="muted">Components V2 전용 메시지 작성기입니다.</p>
      </div>
      <label class="field toggle section-toggle">
        <input type="checkbox" form="embed-settings-form" name="embedEnabled" <%= settings.embed.enabled !== false ? 'checked' : '' %> />
        <span>임베드 기능 활성화</span>
      </label>
    </div>
    <form class="settings-form" id="embed-settings-form" method="post" action="/guild/<%= guild.id %>/settings/embed" data-embed-form>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="field full">
          <span>전송 형식</span>
          <strong>Components V2</strong>
        </div>
        <label class="field full">
          <span>전송 대상</span>
          <select name="embedDestinationType" data-embed-destination>
            <option value="channel" <%= settings.embed.destinationType !== 'webhook' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Discord 채널</option>
            <option value="webhook" <%= settings.embed.destinationType === 'webhook' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Discord 웹훅</option>
          </select>
          <small class="muted">채널을 선택하거나, 별도 서버·채널의 웹훅 링크로 전송할 수 있습니다.</small>
        </label>
        <label class="field full" data-embed-channel-field <%= settings.embed.destinationType === 'webhook' ? 'hidden' : '' %>>
          <span>전송 채널 검색</span>
          <select id="embed-channel-select" name="embedChannelId" data-embed-channel>
            <option value="">전송할 채널 선택</option>
            <% channels.text.forEach((channel) => { %>
              <option value="<%= channel.id %>" <%= settings.embed.channelId === channel.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= channel.label %></option>
            <% }) %>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="field full" data-embed-webhook-field <%= settings.embed.destinationType !== 'webhook' ? 'hidden' : '' %>>
          <span>Discord 웹훅 링크</span>
          <input type="url" name="embedWebhookUrl" value="<%= settings.embed.webhookUrl || '' %>" placeholder="https://discord.com/api/webhooks/..." autocomplete="off" />
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>제목</span>
          <input type="text" name="embedTitle" value="<%= settings.embed.title %>" data-embed-preview="title" />
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>색상</span>
          <input type="color" name="embedColor" value="<%= settings.embed.color %>" data-embed-preview="color" />
        </label>

        <div class="field full" data-embed-format="components" style="<%= settings.embed.mode === 'legacy' ? 'display:none' : '' %>" aria-hidden="<%= settings.embed.mode === 'legacy' ? 'true' : 'false' %>">
          <span>메시지 내용</span>
          <textarea name="embedComponentsBody" rows="9" data-embed-preview="components"><%= settings.embed.componentsBody %></textarea>
          <div class="component-tools" data-component-tools>
            <p class="component-tools-title">사용 가능한 기능</p>
            <div class="component-tool-list">
              <div class="component-tool-row component-tool-row-main">
                <button type="button" class="ghost" data-component-insert="--">-- <span>실선 추가</span></button>
                <button type="button" class="ghost" data-component-insert="[image] ">[image] <span>사진 링크 입력</span></button>
                <button type="button" class="ghost" data-component-insert="[thumbnail] ">[thumbnail] <span>썸네일 링크 입력</span></button>
              </div>
              <div class="component-tool-row component-tool-row-mentions">
                <button type="button" class="ghost" data-component-insert="@everyone">@everyone <span>전체 멘션</span></button>
                <button type="button" class="ghost" data-component-insert="@here">@here <span>온라인 멤버 멘션</span></button>
                <select data-component-role aria-label="멘션할 역할 선택">
                  <option value="">역할 멘션 추가</option>
                  <% roles.filter((role) => role.id !== guild.id).forEach((role) => { %>
                    <option value="<%= role.name %>">@<%= role.name %></option>
                  <% }) %>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <small class="muted">버튼을 누르면 현재 내용의 다음 줄에 문법이 추가됩니다. 역할은 `@역할이름` 형식으로 입력되고 실제 전송 시 해당 역할 멘션으로 변환됩니다.</small>
          </div>
          <small class="muted">입력한 순서대로 표시됩니다. 빈 줄은 줄바꿈, `--`는 실선, `[image] https://이미지주소`는 큰 이미지, `[thumbnail] https://이미지주소`는 썸네일입니다.</small>
        </div>

        <label class="field full">
          <span>푸터</span>
          <input type="text" name="embedFooter" value="<%= settings.embed.footer %>" data-embed-preview="footer" placeholder="메시지 하단에 표시할 푸터" />
        </label>

        <label class="field check-field full">
          <input type="checkbox" name="embedScheduleEnabled" <%= settings.embed.scheduleEnabled ? 'checked' : '' %> />
          <span>주기적으로 자동 전송</span>
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>전송 주기(분)</span>
          <input type="number" min="1" max="10080" name="embedScheduleIntervalMinutes" value="<%= settings.embed.scheduleIntervalMinutes %>" />
        </label>
      </div>
      <div class="form-actions">
        <button class="primary" type="submit">설정 저장</button>
        <button class="ghost" type="button" data-embed-send data-send-url="/guild/<%= guild.id %>/embed/send">지금 전송</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </article>
</section>
